# Used to email 6-digit codes for signup verification and password reset.
# Sent over Brevo's HTTPS API (not SMTP) because Render's free tier
# blocks outbound SMTP ports. Free account: https://app.brevo.com/
#   1. Senders, Domains & Dedicated IPs > Senders > add + verify the
#      email address you want to send FROM.
#   2. SMTP & API > API Keys > create a new key.
# Without these set, codes are just printed to the server console instead
# of being emailed — fine for local testing, not for production.
BREVO_API_KEY=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
BREVO_SENDER_EMAIL=abhigiri2161@gmail.com
